<title>ALGERIA: Bomb kills 10, wounds at least 20 in Algeria.</title>
<headline>Bomb kills 10, wounds at least 20 in Algeria.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A car bomb killed 10 people and wounded at least 20 on Sunday in a suburb of the Algerian capital, security forces said.</p>
<p>The bomb went off near a coach parked by a school in Birkhadem. Security forces described the attack as a &quot;criminal action&quot;, the official Algerian term for attacks by Moslem fundamentalists.</p>
</text>
